-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",301,{
[9601]="70026F08\n1\tTalk to Edhow in Lhan Rhos\030Collect mud-balls (total: 12)\tMud-balls can be found where the bog-beetles dwell, east of Lhan Rhos, and sometimes upon the beetles themselves. Edhow has asked you to gather up as many mud-balls as possible and bring them to him.\n",
[9602]="700544BB\n1\tDefeat fell path-finders (total: 6)\tFell path-finders can be found in the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul. You should defeat any fell path-finders that you find.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many fell path-finders in Minas Morgul.\n",
[9603]="7006B908\n1\tReach the door to the northern interior in Maurûsh\tGalâmka has asked that you observe the northern entrance to the interior of Maurûsh.\n2\tUse the look emote to scout the northern entrance and gain information\tUse the look emote to scout out the northern entrance to the interior of Maurûsh to gain information.\n3\tReach the door to the eastern interior in Maurûsh\tGalâmka has asked that you observe the eastern entrance to the interior of Maurûsh.\n4\tUse the look emote to scout the eastern entrance and gain information\tUse the look emote to scout out the eastern entrance to the interior of Maurûsh to gain information.\n5\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir with the information gained\tReturn to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to inform him of what you learned from your scouting mission.\n",
[9604]="70066D0B\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive the Tokens of Heroism and Hero's Marks barter currency allowances.\n",
[9605]="70053F49\n1\tHabhûk has asked you to patrol the wall surrounding Adambel.\t\n2\tTalk to Habhûk\tHabhûk can be found at Adambel. You should talk to Habhûk.\n",
[9606]="7001A4A7\n1\tCollect tokens of Dol Guldur from goblin-scouts (total: 3)\tGoblin-scouts can be found sneaking throughout the Mirk-eaves. Falasgon has asked you to find and defeat some of the goblin-scouts that have been spotted near Echad Sirion. Perhaps they might carry something that will suggest the location of their camp.\n2\tTalk to Falasgon at Echad Sirion\tFalasgon is at Echad Sirion in the Mirk-eaves. You should bring the tokens you found to Falasgon for his examination.\n",
[9607]="700466D3\n1\tHead to the north section of the outer wall of Minas Tirith\tHead to the north section of the outer wall of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n2\tHead south to continue patrolling the outer wall of the city\tPatrol the outer wall of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n3\tHead south to patrol outside the main gate of the city\tPatrol outside the main gate of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n4\tContinue south on patrol along the outer city wall\tHead south to continue patrolling the outer wall of after-battle Minas Tirith.\n5\tPatrol the southern part of the outer wall of Minas Tirith\tHead to the southern point of after-battle Minas Tirith's outer wall.\n6\tTalk to Éomer\tYou should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[9608]="70039981\n1\tTravel to Fenmarch\tFenmarch lies to the east of Aldburg, in the Eastmarch of Rohan. Thane Arcil is concerned about his neighbours in Fenmarch. He would like for you to patrol the road that leads to Fenmarch, looking for any sign of Orcs or other trouble.\n2\tPatrol the road to Fenmarch\tFenmarch lies eastward upon the road. Patrol the road to Fenmarch.\n3\tContinue patrolling the eastern road to Fenmarch\tThere are no signs of trouble yet. You should continue to patrol the road to Fenmarch.\n4\tFollow the sound of the screams eastward\tScreams can be heard off in the distance to the east. You should follow the screams to locate their source.\n5\tTalk to the panicked Rohirrim woman\tThere is a panicked Rohirrim woman ahead and the screams are now much closer. Speak with the woman to find out what is happening.\n",
[9609]="70034964\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the woods of the Whitshaws\tOrcs can be found in the woods of the northern Whitshaws. You should defeat the Orcs pouring in from Isengard through the Balewood.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in the woods of the Whitshaws (total: 10)\tOrcs can be found in the woods of the northern Whitshaws. You should defeat the Orcs pouring in from Isengard through the Balewood.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the Orc-invaders pouring in from Isengard through the Balewood, making the Whitshaws safer for a short time, at least.\n",
[9610]="70040B02\n1\tDefeat Corsairs (total: 8)\tCorsair footmen can be found patrolling roads around eastern Belfalas as they search for supply carts to ambush. Defeat corsairs in Belfalas.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated corsair footmen in Belfalas.\n",
[9611]="70061422\n1\tBring the report to Diamond\tAdamanda North-took can be found in Nobottle. You should look for Adamanda North-took.\n2\tMeet Diamond by the wall\tThe wall is located west of Tighfield, in Yondershire. Diamond has asked you to meet her by the wall west of Tighfield.\n3\tSearch along the wall for anything amiss\tThe wall is located west of Tighfield. Diamond has asked you to help her patrol the wall for anything suspicious.\n4\tContinue searching along the wall\tThe wall is located west of Tighfield. You should continue patrolling the wall.\n5\tContinue along the wall\tThe wall is located west of Tighfield. You should continue patrolling the wall.\n6\tDefeat demolishing ruffian (total: 4)\030Defeat demolishing thief (total: 6)\tThe wall is located west of Tighfield. You should defeat brigands who are attempting to breach and destroy the wall.\n7\tTalk to Adamanda\tDiamond is waiting for you by the wall west of Tighfield. You should let Diamond know about the Men you defeated.\n",
[9612]="700718F0\n1\tDefeat bandits at Zakhûr (total: 6)\tHalshûm has asked you to defeat bandits at Zakhûr as an act of revenge for what they have done to a woman in his service. Zakhûr is an encampment east of Khanâg Gur in An Shêru.\n2\tTalk to Halshûm in Khanâg Gur\tYou have defeated many bandits at Zakhûr. You should return to Halshûm in Khanâg Gur and tell him of your success.\n",
[9613]="7001ABE7\n1\tReturn the produce to Adso\030Collect Adso's goods (total: 12)\tBrigands in the southern Bree-fields may carry Adso's produce. Adso Haybank is at his camp along the Great East Road. Adso worries that his workers will grow ill without proper meals and has asked you to recover his much-needed produce.\n",
[9614]="7000D819\n1\tTalk to Gunderic Grubb\030Collect Clover (total: 5)\tGunderic Grubb is at The Golden Perch in Stock, south and east of Brockenborings. Sigismond North-took told you to take the clover you collected to Gunderic Grubb.\n2\tUse Stone\030Place Bullroarer's Brew by the statue\tThe statue of the Bullroarer is at the north edge of Brockenborings, north and west of Stock, overlooking the Greenfields. You have been instructed to pay your respects to Bandobras Took by placing a tankard of Bullroarer's Brew near his statue.\n3\tTalk to Sigismond North-took\tSigismond North-took is in Brockenborings. You have paid your respects to Bandobras Took. Now you should return to Sigismond North-took.\n4\tTalk to Tobias Brockhouse\tSpeak with Tobias Brockhouse just east of Brockenborings.\n",
[9615]="70000635\n1\tDefeat Brunmor\tThe brigand, Brunmor, is encamped at the Outlaw's Haven, west and north of Adso's Camp. Desperate to rid himself of his debts and his troubles, Adso Haybank has asked you to deal with Bill Ferny's associate, Brunmor.\n2\tTalk to Adso Haybank at Adso's Camp\tAdso Haybank is at his camp, south-east along the Great East Road. Desperate to rid himself of his troubles, Adso asked you to drive off the brigands who were extorting money from him. The hobbit will be glad to know that you have succeeded.\n",
[9616]="70025B7A\n1\tDefeat the Oath-breaker commander\tOst Heryn is south of Torogethir's camp. Torogethir asked you to venture to Ost Heryn and defeat the Oath-breaker commander there.\n2\tTalk to Torogethir at his camp in Parth Aduial\tTorogethir is at his camp, north of Ost Heryn. Torogethir will be pleased to hear that the Oath-breaker commander has tasted defeat and has vanished.\n",
[9617]="70048CA5\n1\tBurn Drúadan corpses (total: 10)\tDrúadan corpses can be found in the wilds of Agarnaith. You should burn Drúadan corpses and bring back their necklaces.\n2\tTalk to Ghai-buri-Sêk\tGhai-buri-Sêk can be found outside the mountain pass in Agarnaith. You should talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.\n",
[9618]="70066273\n1\tLook north to Edhellond from Amon Lontir\tBoradan has suggested that you look out north towards Edhellond from Amon Lontir.\n2\tTalk to Boradan\tYou have taken in the sight of Edhellond at peace. You should talk to Boradan at Amon Lontir.\n3\tLook west to Dol Amroth from Amon Lontir\tBoradan has suggested that you look out west towards Dol Amroth from Amon Lontir.\n4\tTalk to Boradan\tYou have taken in the sight of Dol Amroth at peace. You should talk to Boradan at Amon Lontir.\n",
[9619]="700309AF\n1\tTalk to Gísling\030Talk to Winsig\tWinsig and Gísling are outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. Having defeated the evil Crúmgam and seen Fastred's son returned to safety, you should speak to the Thanes and great warriors of the Sutcrofts.\n2\tTalk to Gísil\tGísil is outside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. You should return to Gísil and let him know that you have spoken with Gísling and Winsig.\n3\tTalk to Fastred\tFastred can be found inside the Mead Hall of Snowbourn. Gísil told you to speak with Fastred.\n",
[9620]="7005467F\n1\tCollect strange flowers (total: 9)\tStrange flowers can be found in the planters in the Circle of Madness. You should collect strange flowers.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[9621]="70041B26\n1\tDeliver the blackened beaks to a collection box\030Collect blackened beaks (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire blackened beaks.\n",
[9622]="70041B2A\n1\tDeliver the damaged claws to a collection box\030Collect damaged claws (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire damaged claws.\n",
[9623]="70041B28\n1\tDeliver the damaged furs to a collection box\030Collect damaged furs (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire damaged furs.\n",
[9624]="70041B27\n1\tDeliver the pitted sword sheaths to a collection box\030Collect pitted sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire pitted sword sheaths.\n",
[9625]="70041B2C\n1\tDeliver the shattered hatchets to a collection box\030Collect shattered hatchets (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire shattered hatchets.\n",
[9626]="70041B29\n1\tDeliver the shining carapaces to a collection box\030Collect shining carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire shining carapaces.\n",
[9627]="70041B2B\n1\tDeliver the torn skins to a collection box\030Collect torn skins (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire torn skins.\n",
[9628]="70041C82\n1\tCatch pike in the waters of Pelargir (total: 6)\tPike can be found by fishing off the low docks in Pelargir. Firiondur has asked you to gather pike from the waters of Pelargir for the people displaced by the war.\n2\tDeliver the fish to Firiondur in Aerthir\tFiriondur can be found inside the lighthouse at Aerthir in southern-central Lebennin. You have caught several pike and should now bring them to Firiondur.\n",
[9629]="7001BA85\n1\tTalk to Dale Sageford\030Collect smooth wolf-pelts (total: 10)\tWolves can be found throughout the area of the Midgewater Pass. Dale Sageford can be found to the west of the wolf-haunts. Dale Sageford and his companions make their living in pelt-trading, and the Orcs took everything they had and left them to die. He has asked that you aid them in recovering some of the pelts so they can put food into their stomachs upon their return to Bree.\n",
[9630]="70028CA5\n1\tCollect Warg-pelts (total: 5)\tWargs can be found at the warrens, north and east of Garrun's camp. Garrun has asked you to collect pelts from the Wargs in the Isendale.\n2\tBring the Warg-pelts to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun is at his camp, west and south of the Warg-warrens. You should bring the pelts you collected to Garrun.\n",
[9631]="7004E909\n1\tCollect wolf pelts (total: 8)\030Collect láthbear pelts (total: 8)\tYou should collect wolf and láthbear pelts in the valleys of Ered Mithrin.\n2\tBring the pelts to Rúzat at Dôm Goru\tYou should bring the pelts to Rúzat, who can be found at Dôm Goru in Ered Mithrin.\n",
[9632]="70015E36\n1\tBring relics to Faenhilith\030Collect Elf-relics (total: 4)\030Collect Elf-trinkets (total: 6)\tElf-relics and Elf-trinkets are being held by the half-orcs who are encamped at Pembar, north-east of Echad Eregion. Faenhilith has asked you to go to Pembar and defeat the half-orcs there, bringing her any relics or trinkets you find in their possession.\n",
})
